#### Population and seascape genomics of the whitespotted (_Rhynchobatus djiddensis_; A)  and bottlenose (_R. australiae_; B) wedgefishes (Part I) ###

### Overview ###
# This repository contains QC, filtering and denovo assembly scripts used to process raw 3RADseq data for _Rhynchobatus djiddensis_ generated using the NovaSeq S4 high-throughput sequencing (HTS) platforms with paired end (PE) sequencing (2 × 150 bp). PBS scripts are in [brackets]. 
# Our pipeline consists of the following steps:

